{"id":"4ba8845a1d7f7c05","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-identity-universal.md","title":"对角限制的双射","display":"thm-identity-elimination-property — 对角限制的双射","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-identity-universal","aliases":["16-thm-identity-universal","Elimination property of identity types","16-identity-universal"],"display":"thm-identity-elimination-property — 对角限制的双射","depends_on":["[[16-df-identity-type]]"],"review_status":"proved-from-source-rules","review_priority":"P2","review_note_id":"J07","review_date":"2026-10-20","source":"§11.4, p. 681 (PDF 701), beta/eta conversions","review_scope":"Bijection of conversion classes by beta/eta; not raw-term uniqueness","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-identity-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-identity-universal</span><span>Elimination property of identity types</span><span>16-identity-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-identity-elimination-property — 对角限制的双射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"proved-from-source-rules"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P2"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J07"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.4, p. 681 (PDF 701), beta/eta conversions"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Bijection of conversion classes by beta/eta; not raw-term uniqueness"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a> 中一个规则包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal R_\\kappa\\)</span> 及包含它的演算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>；表达式为有限编码，判断等式有等价、合同与替换规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi=\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\">\\(\\Xi=\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi_\\theta=\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\">\\(\\Xi_\\theta=\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\)</span> 为良构语境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=[a/b,r_A(a)/z]\">\\(\\theta=[a/b,r_A(a)/z]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind})\">\\(\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind})\\)</span>。选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\">\\(\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\)</span> 成立，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell)\">\\(\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell)\\)</span>；两个形式谓词/函数均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a>。因此弱包的目标在删去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的语境中形成，很强包的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 必为空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[Q]_\\equiv\">\\([Q]_\\equiv\\)</span> 表示在固定上下文和固定结果类型上的判断等式类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span> 是该包的消去表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi\\vdash Q:C)\">\\(\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi\\vdash Q:C)\\)</span> 表示判断有有限推导。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_C\\coloneqq\\{[Q]_\\equiv\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi\\vdash Q:C)\\},\\qquad\nD_C\\coloneqq\\{[d]_\\equiv\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi_\\theta\\vdash d:C\\theta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_C\\coloneqq\\{[Q]_\\equiv\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi\\vdash Q:C)\\},\\qquad\nD_C\\coloneqq\\{[d]_\\equiv\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi_\\theta\\vdash d:C\\theta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_C:U_C\\to D_C,\\quad\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq[Q\\theta]_\\equiv,\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C:D_C\\to U_C,\\quad\\epsilon_C([d]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq\n[\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z)]_\\equiv.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_C:U_C\\to D_C,\\quad\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq[Q\\theta]_\\equiv,\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C:D_C\\to U_C,\\quad\\epsilon_C([d]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq\n[\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z)]_\\equiv.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_C\\circ\\epsilon_C=\\operatorname{id}_{D_C},\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\rho_C=\\operatorname{id}_{U_C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_C\\circ\\epsilon_C=\\operatorname{id}_{D_C},\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\rho_C=\\operatorname{id}_{U_C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall[d]_\\equiv\\in D_C\\ \\exists![Q]_\\equiv\\in U_C\\quad\n\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)=[d]_\\equiv.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall[d]_\\equiv\\in D_C\\ \\exists![Q]_\\equiv\\in U_C\\quad\n\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)=[d]_\\equiv.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 转换，p. 681（PDF 701）；这里显式推出它们共同表达的限制双射。替换与合同保证两映射不依赖代表元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_C\\epsilon_C=1\">\\(\\rho_C\\epsilon_C=1\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=z\">\\(p=z\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_C\\rho_C=1\">\\(\\epsilon_C\\rho_C=1\\)</span>，所以存在和唯一均有推导依据。</li>\n<li>唯一性是在判断等式类上，而非字符串相同；没有把 syntactic terms 当作某个模型中的全部项。删除 Remark 后，商集、映射、适用强度和结论仍在前两节中完整给出。</li>\n<li>旧陈述只复述 intensional <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的存在及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>，并未得到本书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>；现行命题依赖本书明确列出的两条转换，不能移植到只有 intensional <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J/\\beta\">\\(J/\\beta\\)</span> 的系统。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-identity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-identity-type]] 中一个规则包 $\\mathcal R_\\kappa$ 及包含它的演算 $\\mathcal T$；表达式为有限编码，判断等式有等价、合同与替换规则。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Xi=\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)$ 与 $\\Xi_\\theta=\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]$ 为良构语境，$\\theta=[a/b,r_A(a)/z]$；$\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind})$。选择 $\\ell$ 使 $\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)$ 成立，并假设 $\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell)$；两个形式谓词/函数均采用 [[16-df-identity-type]]。因此弱包的目标在删去 $z$ 的语境中形成，很强包的 $\\Delta$ 必为空。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Xi=\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Xi_\\theta=\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta=[a/b,r_A(a)/z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind})","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"[Q]_\\equiv","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi\\vdash Q:C)","display":false},{"tex":"U_C\\coloneqq\\{[Q]_\\equiv\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi\\vdash Q:C)\\},\\qquad\nD_C\\coloneqq\\{[d]_\\equiv\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash(\\Xi_\\theta\\vdash d:C\\theta)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_C:U_C\\to D_C,\\quad\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq[Q\\theta]_\\equiv,\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C:D_C\\to U_C,\\quad\\epsilon_C([d]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq\n[\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z)]_\\equiv.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_C\\circ\\epsilon_C=\\operatorname{id}_{D_C},\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\rho_C=\\operatorname{id}_{U_C}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall[d]_\\equiv\\in D_C\\ \\exists![Q]_\\equiv\\in U_C\\quad\n\\rho_C([Q]_\\equiv)=[d]_\\equiv.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_C\\epsilon_C=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"p=z","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon_C\\rho_C=1","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"J/\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":2837,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-identity-universal|thm-identity-elimination-property — 对角限制的双射]]"},{"id":"6cd0133ac0d843a2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Xi,C,U_C,D_C,\\rho_C,\\epsilon_C$ 及所选相等强度完全采用 [[16-thm-identity-universal]] 的定义和侧条件。"}],"outgoing":["5c7f9132ab843c91"]}